	"changenote"		"[h2]v0.9.8  (2026-09-22)[/h2]
[h3]中文[/h3]
[list]
[*][b]重要修复:国内下载模型卡住不动[/b]。查实原因:国内能打开的镜像站只提供文件列表,真正的大文件还是从海外服务器下,速度极慢或直接卡死,而程序没发现卡住、一直在等。现在下载前会[b]同时给几个下载源测速[/b](HuggingFace / 镜像 / 魔搭 ModelScope),谁快用谁;国内一般会自动走魔搭。
[*][b]断点续传 + 自动换源[/b]:下载中途卡住或太慢,会自动换到下一个源[b]接着下[/b],不从头来;关掉程序后再点下载也能接着上次的进度。
[*][b]下完自动校验文件完整性[/b],损坏的文件不会被当成'已就绪'。
[*]之前下载卡住的朋友:更新后在「音频与模型设置」里重新点一次下载即可。
[/list]
[h3]English[/h3]
[list]
[*][b]Important fix: model downloads stuck in mainland China[/b]. The mirror that works in China only serves the file list; the large model file still came from an overseas server that crawls or stalls, and the app kept waiting forever. Downloads now [b]speed-test every source in parallel[/b] first (HuggingFace / mirror / ModelScope) and use the fastest; users in China are routed to ModelScope automatically.
[*][b]Resume + automatic source switching[/b]: if a download stalls or crawls, it switches to the next source and [b]continues where it stopped[/b] instead of restarting; closing the app and clicking download again also resumes.
[*][b]Files are integrity-checked (sha256) after download[/b], so a corrupted file is never treated as ready.
[*]If your download got stuck before: after updating, just click download again in Audio & Model Setup.
[/list]"
}
